cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "scRANK-DKD: a leakage-controlled within-sample rank framework for cross-cohort kidney transcriptomics"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, frozen analysis plan, result tables and figures for the
  scRANK-DKD framework: single-cell-derived cell-state programs constrain the
  candidate gene space, a within-sample percentile-rank encoding removes
  dependence on absolute expression scale, and a light penalized aggregator is
  evaluated under a leakage-free leave-one-cohort-out protocol.
